      en: ["The building was officially completed on May 1, 1940, days before the invasion.", "The architect Willem Marinus Dudok also designed the famous Hilversum Town Hall.", "Erasmus House is listed as a Dutch national monument (Rijksmonument).", "The building survived the 1940 Rotterdam Blitz while nearly everything around it fell.", "The design emphasizes verticality through a 35-meter-high clock tower.", "It features white glazed bricks that were specifically chosen for their durability."],
