      en: ["The Renaissance facade was designed in 1597 by architect Lieven de Key", "A major fire on January 12, 1929, destroyed most of the structure", "The modern reconstruction was completed between 1932 and 1935", "It features the longest Renaissance facade in the entire Netherlands", "The city hall tower contains a carillon with 52 bronze bells", "The building is designated as a national monument (Rijksmonument)"],
      es: ["Periodo de construcción: 1595–1597", "Estilo: Renacimiento holandés", "Fachada: de seis partes", "Ridderzaal: con chimenea", "Daños de guerra: sí, restaurado", "Visitantes anuales: 80.000"],
      pt: ["Período de construção: 1595–1597", "Estilo: Renascimento holandês", "Fachada: de seis partes", "Ridderzaal: com lareira", "Danos de guerra: sim, restaurado", "Visitantes anuais: 80.000"],
      fr: ["Période de construction : 1595–1597", "Style : Renaissance hollandaise", "Façade : en six parties", "Ridderzaal : avec cheminée", "Dommages de guerre : oui, restauré", "Visiteurs annuels : 80 000"],
